{"id": "3784", "title": "U　KEY", "author": "诱惑红", "category": "玄幻魔法", "count": 9, "available": 9, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/3/3784.htm", "intro": "引：\r\n　　key——翅果。\r\n　　只有一枚翅膀也可以飞行的种子。\r\n　　即使只有一枚翅膀……青空，晨光，柔风，都依旧属于那颗自由的心。\r\n　　即使是孤单的……这个世界上定有一片土地属于这枚翅果，也许再飞得远一些，就可以遇见另一半翅膀了吧，也许再飞的高一些，就可以看见天堂了吧……", "base": "files/article/html/3/3784", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章 阡&迁", "file": "315537.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第二章  潇儿&九尾", "file": "315539.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第三章 佑希&过去", "file": "315541.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第四章 过去&各自的回忆", "file": "315543.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第五章 龙潭&灰翼", "file": "315545.html", "available": true}, {"title": "番外篇", "volume": true}, {"title": "yuki「上」（本章节bl情节...", "file": "315548.html", "available": true}, {"title": "yuki「中」（本章节bl情节...", "file": "315550.html", "available": true}, {"title": "yuki（下)", "file": "315552.html", "available": true}, {"title": "——耽美，慎入！", "file": "315555.html", "available": true}]}